DATA BUILT FROM OPENSTREETMAP: Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0

These files contain or derive from OpenStreetMap data, so they are released
under the ODbL 1.0, the licence OpenStreetMap requires for derived databases:

- app/public/data/graph.json (walk network, access flags, crossings)
- app/public/data/places.json (named places)
- app/public/data/hours.json (opening hours; OSM rows plus hours cited from a
  public mall guide, each row with its source)
- app/public/data/buildings_display.geojson and pipeline/inputs/buildings.geojson
  (building outlines and heights)
- app/public/data/shade.bin and the shadow overlay images (shade computed from
  the building data above, Google Open Buildings heights, and tree canopy)

Attribution: "© OpenStreetMap contributors, undercover.ph"
Licence text: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
OpenStreetMap copyright: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

UPSTREAM DATA (cited, not re-licensed by us):

- OpenStreetMap: © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0. Geofabrik extract
  philippines-261020.
- Google Open Buildings 2.5D Temporal (2023 heights): CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Modified: clipped to the
  Makati area and merged with OpenStreetMap footprints.
  https://sites.research.google/gr/open-buildings/temporal/
- Tree canopy height (pipeline/inputs/canopy_height_makati.tif, a clip):
  Meta and World Resources Institute (WRI), 2024. High Resolution Canopy
  Height Maps (CHM). CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
  Modified: clipped to the Makati area. Source imagery for CHM © 2016 Maxar.
- Weather (app/public/data/weather.json): Open-Meteo, CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
- Thunderstorm advisory text (app/public/data/advisory.json): PAGASA, a
  Philippine government work, shown with credit and a link to the source.
- Basemap tiles at runtime: OpenFreeMap, © OpenMapTiles, © OpenStreetMap
  contributors.

This summary is not legal advice. The upstream licence texts govern.
